flowchart TD
    A[Proposed Agent Action] --> B{Action Type}

    B -->|read-only| C[Auto-Allow]
    B -->|reversible edit| D[Soft Confirm]
    B -->|destructive or financial| E[Mandatory Confirm]

    C --> F[Execute]

    D --> G{Risk Score}
    G -->|low| F
    G -->|medium/high| E

    E --> H[Approval Payload\nwhat changes, cost impact, rollback]
    H --> U[User Decision]

    U -->|approve| I[Execute with Audit Trail]
    U -->|reject| J[Return to Orchestrator\nrevise plan]

    I --> K[Post-Execution Validation\nconsistency + policy checks]
    K --> L[Persist State + Summarize]

    F --> K
    J --> M((End without action))
    L --> N((End))
